    "name": "Medieval Chaos",
    "steam_appid": 2990580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolution update like never seen before!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 new skins to play;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story for the King seeking to reclaim his kingdom;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New visuals for the game's menus;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated maps;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely revamped gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New physics system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustments to the video resolution system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shader effects for wind and object transparency;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and difficulty tweaks on some maps;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various bug fixes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#########################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your kingdom from thousands of monsters in this fast paced pixel art game. Can you survive the harsh environment and the deadly creatures that inhabit it? Find out in this thrilling adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Merge. Slay. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Medieval Chaos</strong>, a pixelated roguelike packed with weapon fusions, medieval mayhem, and absurd fun. Fight off swarms of enemies with unpredictable loadouts, random upgrades, and non-stop action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Weapon Merge System:</strong>Combine swords, spells, bows, and absurd weapons to create legendary combos mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Endless Enemies:</strong>Face relentless waves in randomly generated arenas. Dodge, slay, and upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Chaos Every Time:</strong>Procedural maps, enemies, and upgrades mean no run feels the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>For Fans Of:</strong>Vampire Survivors \u2022 Brotato \u2022 Soulstone Survivors \u2022 20 Minutes Till Dawn</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolution update like never seen before!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 new skins to play;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story for the King seeking to reclaim his kingdom;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New visuals for the game's menus;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated maps;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely revamped gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New physics system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustments to the video resolution system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shader effects for wind and object transparency;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and difficulty tweaks on some maps;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various bug fixes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#########################################################</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your kingdom from thousands of monsters in this fast paced pixel art game. Can you survive the harsh environment and the deadly creatures that inhabit it? Find out in this thrilling adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Merge. Slay. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Medieval Chaos</strong>, a pixelated roguelike packed with weapon fusions, medieval mayhem, and absurd fun. Fight off swarms of enemies with unpredictable loadouts, random upgrades, and non-stop action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Weapon Merge System:</strong>Combine swords, spells, bows, and absurd weapons to create legendary combos mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Endless Enemies:</strong>Face relentless waves in randomly generated arenas. Dodge, slay, and upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Chaos Every Time:</strong>Procedural maps, enemies, and upgrades mean no run feels the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>For Fans Of:</strong>Vampire Survivors \u2022 Brotato \u2022 Soulstone Survivors \u2022 20 Minutes Till Dawn</p>",
    "short_description": "Slay, merge, and survive in this pixel roguelike battleground! Craft deadly weapons, fight endless hordes, and embrace medieval madness.",
